 "O01": {
  "dur": 30.902875,
  "text": "So, what should your blood pressure be after 65? There's no one number that's right for everyone. The real question is, is it being controlled safely? If you feel dizzy when you stand, keep falling, or feel unwell after your medicine, talk to your doctor. The goal isn't just a lower number, it's better protection. And never change your blood pressure medicine on your own.",
